OL,3,ATear gas in Paris and Marseille as
OL,4,Aschool protests grow across France
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of thousands of people have
OL,7,Ftaken to the streets across France, as
OL,8,Fa wave of protests by high-school
OL,9,Fpupils spread to their parents,
OL,10,Funiversity students and unions.
OL,12,FCrowds of teenagers marched from the
OL,13,FPlace de la Republique in Paris,
OL,14,Fcalling for more resources for schools,
OL,15,Fand what they called less repression
OL,16,Ffrom police.
OL,18,FPolice clashed with demonstrators in
OL,19,FLyon, used tear gas in Paris and
OL,20,FMarseille and water cannon in Rennes,
OL,21,Fbut there was little of the serious
OL,22,Ftrouble that marred previous protests.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
